devel
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

bug fixes
  - robust.seas(): fallbacks now work when called from inside a function (the
    documented parLapply example), when a fallback argument was also supplied
    by the user (it now overrides instead of duplicating), when 'x' is a
    non-symbolic expression, and the start-year adjustment actually reaches
    'seas' instead of being written to a dead environment. 'estimate.maxiter'
    is only raised when the error suggests it (now also matching the current
    X-13 'maximum iterations reached' message), but then stays active for all
    subsequent retries.

0.1  2016-08-01
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

new features
  - robust.seas(): a robust version of seas that always works (experimental)

